{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Camera｜流程图\n一次视角拉取的主路径。类与接口见[[GGYGO_结构_相机.canvas|结构图]]、[[Camera/结构|结构文档]]；细节见[[GGYGO_流程_相机覆盖恢复.canvas|覆盖恢复]]、[[GGYGO_流程_相机模式求值.canvas|模式求值]]。\nGate30四Camera叶Success、测试errors/warnings=0；完整矩阵/资产/网络仍开放。[[Camera/模式栈实现#已验证与待审查边界|其它自动替代待审查]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1890,
      "height": 145,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "engine",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. UE通过ViewTarget每次拉取GetCameraView。\n入口生成有限非负SafeDeltaTime供本次管线使用。\n同帧多次拉取各按传入dt求值/推进，没有帧号去重。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "look-input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "0. 视角输入先更新 Controller.ControlRotation。\n\n资产：BP_PC_Pyrios 注册 IMC_Default + IMC_MouseLook；IA_Look / IA_MouseLook → Look.Stick / Look.Mouse。\n回调：HeroComponent::Input_Look* → AddControllerYawInput / AddControllerPitchInput。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 890,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "choose",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. HeroComponent 从 Ability 覆盖列表或 PawnData 选有效模式。\n\n当前默认：DA_Pawn_Pyrios.DefaultCameraMode → BP_CameraMode_ThirdPerson_Pyrios_C。\nDetermineCameraModeDelegate 返回 Mode Class；空返回不清除已有活动栈。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 255,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "push",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. CameraComponent处理本次拉取的模式类并检查栈。\nClass非空→PushCameraMode复用并置顶。\n空Class只跳过Push；已有栈继续。\n只有活动栈空才进入Super分支。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 255,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "evaluate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. Stack 同时输出混合 View 与聚合穿透请求。\n[[GGYGO_流程_相机模式求值.canvas|展开]]\n\n`EvaluateStack(SafeDt, OutView, OutRequest)`：更新模式、混合 View、按实际贡献聚合请求。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 255,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "offset",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. UpdateCameraOffsetAlpha → ApplyCameraOffset。\n消费已接受单槽；Set属申请阶段。\n非法Set：Error/Invalid、入口保持；[[Camera/模式栈实现#Offset 单槽所有权|申请契约]]。\n合法alpha/正时间：SafeDt0不推进。\n合法零时间即到目标，SafeDt0亦可。\nalpha>0且Offset非近零才施加：旋转位置叠加，\nFOV钳5–170；不代替Set拒绝；token管所有权。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "output",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "7. 输出给引擎：两条互斥路径。\n模式：写组件位置/Rotation/FOV和DesiredView；\n有Pawn Controller时同步ControlRotation。\n空栈：Super直接填DesiredView并return，\n不进入项目写回；此节点只表示引擎接收视图。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 1330,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "empty",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "活动栈空：恢复比例置1；\n同一SafeDt→UCameraComponent::GetCameraView，\n随后直接return到引擎。\n跳过项目Mode/Offset/Resolve/组件/Controller写回。\n空Class但栈非空继续求值，不走此分支。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 1330,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "collision",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "6. ResolveCameraPenetration保护Offset后最终位置。\n启用Request且World/Target/路径有效：\n每次拉取至多一次ECC_Camera查询，忽略Target。\nRadius>0 sweep；合法0 line trace。\n收近立即；正Recovery渐复，合法0立即恢复。\n[[GGYGO_流程_相机模式求值.canvas|详细求值及边界]]。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e0",
      "fromNode": "look-input",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "engine",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "ControlRotation → Pawn ViewRotation"
    },
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "engine",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "choose",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "GetCameraView → UpdateCameraModes"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "choose",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "push",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "返回 Class；空类不清旧栈"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "push",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "evaluate",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "活动栈非空 → EvaluateStack"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "evaluate",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "offset",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "OutView + OutRequest"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "offset",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "collision",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Offset 后最终位置"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "fromNode": "push",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "empty",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "活动栈为空"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7",
      "fromNode": "empty",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "output",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Super直接输出DesiredView到引擎并return"
    },
    {
      "id": "e8",
      "fromNode": "collision",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "output",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "最终安全 View"
    }
  ]
}
